{"name": "Scientific Calculator", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Scientific Calculator — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover,user-scalable=no\">\n<title>Scientific Calculator</title>\n<meta name=\"myllm:immersive\" content=\"on\">\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"179a901b5f\";color-scheme:light dark;\n  --bg1:#0b0d12; --bg2:#161a23; --ink:#f5f6f8; --muted:#8c93a3; --faint:#5b6272;\n  --digit:#262b36; --digit-hi:rgba(255,255,255,.07); --sci:#1a1e27; --sci-ink:#c7cedb;\n  --fn:#343a47; --op1:#ffae3d; --op2:#ff7a1a; --op-ink:#fff; --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  --chip:rgba(255,255,255,.07); --glow:rgba(255,140,40,.35); --shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05) inset,0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n  --font:-apple-system,\"SF Pro Display\",system-ui,sans-serif; }\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:light){ :root{\n  --bg1:#f6f3ee; --bg2:#ebe6de; --ink:#16181d; --muted:#7b7f89; --faint:#a9acb3;\n  --digit:#ffffff; --digit-hi:rgba(255,255,255,.4); --sci:#e4dfd6; --sci-ink:#3b3f48;\n  --fn:#d6d0c5; --line:rgba(0,0,0,.08); --chip:rgba(0,0,0,.05); --glow:rgba(255,130,30,.28);\n  --shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.9) inset,0 4px 10px rgba(80,60,30,.12); } }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\nhtml,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;overscroll-behavior:none}\nbody{font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink);background:radial-gradient(120% 70% at 50% 0%,var(--bg2),var(--bg1) 70%);\n  background-color:var(--bg1);height:100vh;height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n  padding:env(safe-area-inset-top) calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(10px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-left));\n  touch-action:manipulation}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer}\n\n/* Header */\n.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 2px 4px;flex-shrink:0}\n.tile{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;\n  background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--op1),var(--op2));box-shadow:0 4px 12px var(--glow)}\n.tile svg{width:19px;height:19px;color:#fff}\n.ht{min-width:0;flex:1}\n.ht h1{font-size:17px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.2px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.acts{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.hbtn{height:36px;min-width:36px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--chip);display:grid;place-items:center;\n  font-size:13px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--ink);transition:transform .12s,background .2s}\n.hbtn:active{transform:scale(.93)}\n.hbtn svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.hbtn.on{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--op1),var(--op2));color:#fff}\n#angle{min-width:52px}\n\n/* Display */\n.display{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;min-height:84px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;\n  padding:6px 8px 10px;overflow:hidden}\n.prev{font-size:19px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;min-height:27px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;\n  direction:ltr;transition:opacity .25s}\n.main{text-align:right;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1.3;white-space:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;\n  scrollbar-width:none;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;padding:0 0 .08em;font-size:64px;cursor:text}\n.main::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.main.result{font-weight:250}\n.main.pop{animation:pop .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.2)}\n@keyframes pop{from{transform:translateY(18px);opacity:.2}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}\n.main.shake{animation:shake .38s}\n@keyframes shake{20%,60%{transform:translateX(-8px)}40%,80%{transform:translateX(8px)}}\n.sub{font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;min-height:31px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.sub.err{color:#ff6b5e}\n.caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:.9em;background:var(--op2);vertical-align:-.08em;margin-left:2px;border-radius:1px;animation:blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite}\n@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}\n.t-op{color:var(--op2);margin:0 .12em;font-weight:400}\n.t-fn{color:var(--sci-ink);font-weight:400}\n.t-sup{font-size:.62em;vertical-align:.62em;margin-left:.02em}\n.t-ghost{color:var(--faint)}\n.t-e{font-size:.7em;color:var(--muted);margin:0 .06em}\n.ind{position:absolute;left:10px;top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px}\n.pill{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.6px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--chip);border-radius:7px;padding:3px 7px}\n.pill.hide{display:none}\n.toast{position:absolute;left:50%;top:12px;transform:translate(-50%,-8px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg1);\n  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:10px;transition:.25s}\n.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n\n/* Memory row */\n.mem{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:0 2px 8px;flex-shrink:0}\n.mem button{flex:1;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--chip);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);transition:transform .1s}\n.mem button:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n.mem .fold{flex:0 0 44px;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.mem .fold svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;transition:transform .25s}\nbody.nosci .mem .fold svg{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n\n/* Keys */\n.pads{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex-shrink:0}\n.sci{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px}\n.basic{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}\nbody.nosci .sci{display:none}\nbody.nosci .basic .k{height:clamp(60px,10.4vh,100px)}\n.k{position:relative;border-radius:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\n  transition:transform .09s ease,filter .15s;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}\n.k::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--digit-hi),transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}\n.k:active,.k.down{transform:scale(.94);filter:brightness(1.18)}\n.sci .k{height:clamp(32px,4.6vh,46px);background:var(--sci);color:var(--sci-ink);font-size:16px;font-weight:500;border-radius:13px}\n.sci .k.on{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--op1),var(--op2));color:#fff}\n.sci .k .sup{font-size:.68em;vertical-align:.55em}\n.basic .k{height:clamp(50px,7.6vh,84px);background:var(--digit);font-size:31px;font-weight:400}\n.basic .k.fn{background:var(--fn);font-size:22px;font-weight:500}\n.basic .k.op{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--op1),var(--op2));color:var(--op-ink);font-size:32px;font-weight:450}\n.basic .k.op.eq{box-shadow:0 8px 22px var(--glow),var(--shadow)}\n.basic .k.op.armed{background:var(--op-ink);color:var(--op2)}\n.k svg{width:26px;height:26px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n\n/* History */\n.hist{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--bg1);border-radius:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transform:translateY(-104%);\n  transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),visibility 0s .32s;z-index:3;visibility:hidden}\n.hist.open{transform:none;visibility:visible;transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}\n.hist .hh{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 12px 6px}\n.hist .hh b{font-size:15px}\n.hist .hh button{font-size:14px;color:var(--op2);font-weight:600;padding:6px}\n.hist ul{list-style:none;overflow-y:auto;flex:1;padding:0 12px 12px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}\n.hist li{padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right;cursor:pointer}\n.hist li:active{background:var(--chip)}\n.hist li .e{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.hist li .r{font-size:24px;font-weight:350;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.hist .none{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;padding:30px 0;font-size:15px}\n\n/* Ask sheet */\n.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .25s;z-index:8}\n.scrim.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.sheet{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:9;background:var(--bg2);border-radius:22px 22px 0 0;\n  padding:16px calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-right)) calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) calc(16px + env(safe-area-inset-left));\n  transform:translateY(105%);transition:transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);box-shadow:0 -10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}\n.sheet.open{transform:none}\n.sheet h2{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:4px}\n.sheet p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px}\n.sheet textarea{width:100%;min-height:74px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg1);color:var(--ink);\n  font:inherit;font-size:17px;padding:12px;resize:none;-webkit-user-select:text;user-select:text;outline:none}\n.sheet textarea:focus{border-color:var(--op2)}\n.sheet .row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\n.sheet .row button{flex:1;height:46px;border-radius:13px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;background:var(--chip)}\n.sheet .row .go{background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--op1),var(--op2));color:#fff}\n.sheet .row .go[disabled]{opacity:.55}\n.sheet .msg{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;min-height:18px}\n.chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}\n.chips button{font-size:12.5px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--chip);color:var(--sci-ink)}\n\n/* Landscape: scientific keys beside the basic pad */\n@media (orientation:landscape) and (max-height:560px){\n  .display{min-height:70px;padding-bottom:4px}\n  .main{font-size:44px}\n  .prev{font-size:15px;min-height:18px}\n  .sub{font-size:17px;min-height:22px}\n  .mem{padding-bottom:6px}\n  .mem button{height:26px}\n  .mem .fold{display:none}\n  .pads{flex-direction:row;gap:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n  .sci{flex:1.25;gap:6px;display:grid !important}\n  .basic{flex:1;gap:6px}\n  .sci .k{height:calc((100dvh - 200px - env(safe-area-inset-bottom) - 18px) / 4);min-height:28px;font-size:14px}\n  .basic .k,body.nosci .basic .k{height:calc((100dvh - 200px - env(safe-area-inset-bottom) - 24px) / 5);min-height:26px;font-size:22px;border-radius:13px}\n  .basic .k.fn{font-size:17px}\n  .basic .k.op{font-size:24px}\n  .head{padding-top:4px}\n  .sci{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}\n}\n@media (max-width:350px){ .basic .k{font-size:26px} .sci .k{font-size:14px} .main{font-size:52px} }\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .k:active,.k.down{transform:none} .main.pop,.main.shake{animation:none} .caret{animation:none} }\n\n/* myllm-fullscreen-v2 — MyLLM 5.6.2+ opens this app full screen; the ✕ is the way out. */\n.head .imm-acts{display:none;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:auto}\n.head .acts + .imm-acts{margin-left:0}\nbody.imm .head .imm-acts{display:flex}\n.head .imm-acts button{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  background:var(--chip);color:var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s}\n.head .imm-acts button:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n.imm-acts svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;stroke-linecap:round}\n.imm-safe{display:none}\nbody.imm .imm-safe{display:block}\n</style></head><body>\n\n<div class=\"imm-safe\"></div><div class=\"head\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M8.5 7.5h7M9 12h.01M12 12h.01M15 12h.01M9 16h.01M12 16h.01M15 16h.01\"/></svg></div>\n  <div class=\"ht\"><h1>Calculator</h1></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\">\n    <button class=\"hbtn\" id=\"angle\" aria-label=\"Angle unit\">DEG</button>\n    <button class=\"hbtn\" id=\"askBtn\" aria-label=\"Describe a sum\" hidden><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.8 4.6L18.5 9l-4.7 1.6L12 15l-1.8-4.4L5.5 9l4.7-1.4z\"/><path d=\"M18.5 15.5l.8 1.9 1.9.7-1.9.8-.8 1.9-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.7z\"/></svg></button>\n    <button class=\"hbtn\" id=\"histBtn\" aria-label=\"History\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3.5 12a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 2.6-6.1\"/><path d=\"M3.5 4.5v4h4\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12l3 2\"/></svg></button>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"imm-acts\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close Scientific Calculator\" onclick=\"myllmFSClose()\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg></button></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"display\" id=\"display\">\n  <div class=\"ind\"><span class=\"pill hide\" id=\"memPill\">M</span><span class=\"pill hide\" id=\"secPill\">2ND</span></div>\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\">Copied</div>\n  <div class=\"prev\" id=\"prev\"></div>\n  <div class=\"main\" id=\"main\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n  <div class=\"sub\" id=\"sub\"></div>\n  <div class=\"hist\" id=\"hist\">\n    <div class=\"hh\"><button id=\"histClear\">Clear</button><b>History</b><button id=\"histDone\">Done</button></div>\n    <ul id=\"histList\"></ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mem\">\n  <button data-m=\"mc\" aria-label=\"Memory clear\">MC</button><button data-m=\"m+\" aria-label=\"Memory add\">M+</button><button data-m=\"m-\" aria-label=\"Memory subtract\">M−</button><button data-m=\"mr\" aria-label=\"Memory recall\">MR</button>\n  <button class=\"fold\" id=\"fold\" aria-label=\"Show or hide scientific keys\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 15l6-6 6 6\"/></svg></button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pads\">\n  <div class=\"sci\" id=\"sci\"></div>\n  <div class=\"basic\" id=\"basic\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n<div class=\"sheet\" id=\"sheet\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Describe a sum\">\n  <h2>Describe a sum</h2>\n  <p>Your AI turns the words into an expression. The calculator does the maths.</p>\n  <div class=\"chips\" id=\"chips\"></div>\n  <textarea id=\"askText\" placeholder=\"e.g. 15% tip on 64.50 split between 3\"></textarea>\n  <div class=\"row\"><button id=\"askCancel\">Cancel</button><button class=\"go\" id=\"askGo\">Work it out</button></div>\n  <div class=\"msg\" id=\"askMsg\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n'use strict';\nvar $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id)};\n\n/* ---------- Keys ----------\n   Each key: [label, token or action, 2nd label, 2nd token]. Tokens are what\n   the expression holds; a function token carries its own \"(\". */\nvar SCI=[\n  ['2nd','@2nd'],['(','('],[')',')'],['mod','mod'],['Ans','Ans'],\n  ['sin','sin(','sin<span class=\"sup\">−1</span>','asin('],['cos','cos(','cos<span class=\"sup\">−1</span>','acos('],\n  ['tan','tan(','tan<span class=\"sup\">−1</span>','atan('],['ln','ln(','e<span class=\"sup\">x</span>','@exp'],['log','log(','10<span class=\"sup\">x</span>','@pow10'],\n  ['x<span class=\"sup\">2</span>','²','x<span class=\"sup\">3</span>','³'],['x<span class=\"sup\">y</span>','^','<span class=\"sup\">y</span>√x','yroot'],\n  ['√','√(','∛','∛('],['x!','!'],['1/x','⁻¹','log<span class=\"sup\">2</span>','log₂('],\n  ['π','π','sinh','sinh('],['e','e','cosh','cosh('],['EE','E','tanh','tanh('],['nCr','nCr','nPr','nPr'],['|x|','abs(','Rand','@rand']\n];\nvar BASIC=[\n  ['AC','@ac','fn'],['<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 5h11v14H9l-6-7z\"/><path d=\"M12.5 9.5l5 5M17.5 9.5l-5 5\"/></svg>','@bs','fn'],['±','@neg','fn'],['÷','÷','op'],\n  ['7','7'],['8','8'],['9','9'],['×','×','op'],\n  ['4','4'],['5','5'],['6','6'],['−','−','op'],\n  ['1','1'],['2','2'],['3','3'],['+','+','op'],\n  ['0','0'],['.','.'],['%','%','fn'],['=','@eq','op eq']\n];\n\n/* ---------- State ---------- */\nvar S={tokens:[],angle:'deg',second:false,sci:true,mem:0,ans:0,history:[],shown:null,justEq:false};\nvar STORE='scicalc.v1';\nfunction save(){\n  var d=JSON.stringify({angle:S.angle,sci:S.sci,mem:S.mem,ans:S.ans,history:S.history.slice(-60)});\n  try{ if(window.myllmStorage){ myllmStorage.setItem(STORE,d); return; } }catch(e){}\n  try{ localStorage.setItem(STORE,d); }catch(e){}\n}\nfunction load(done){\n  function apply(v){ if(v){ try{ var d=JSON.parse(v);\n    if(d.angle==='rad'||d.angle==='deg')S.angle=d.angle; S.sci=d.sci!==false;\n    if(typeof d.mem==='number')S.mem=d.mem; if(typeof d.ans==='number')S.ans=d.ans;\n    if(Array.isArray(d.history))S.history=d.history.filter(function(h){return h&&Array.isArray(h.t)&&typeof h.r==='number'}); }catch(e){} }\n    done(); }\n  try{ if(window.myllmStorage){ myllmStorage.getItem(STORE).then(apply,function(){apply(null)}); return; } }catch(e){}\n  var v=null; try{ v=localStorage.getItem(STORE); }catch(e){} apply(v);\n}\n\n/* ---------- Tokens ---------- */\nvar FUNCS=['sin(','cos(','tan(','asin(','acos(','atan(','sinh(','cosh(','tanh(','ln(','log(','log₂(','√(','∛(','abs('];\nvar BINOPS=['+','−','×','÷','^','mod','nCr','nPr','yroot'];\nvar POSTFIX=['²','³','!','%','⁻¹'];\nvar CONSTS=['π','e','Ans'];\nfunction isDigit(t){return t.length===1&&(t>='0'&&t<='9'||t==='.')}\nfunction isFunc(t){return FUNCS.indexOf(t)>=0}\nfunction isBin(t){return t!==undefined&&BINOPS.indexOf(t)>=0}\nfunction isPost(t){return POSTFIX.indexOf(t)>=0}\nfunction isConst(t){return CONSTS.indexOf(t)>=0}\nfunction startsOperand(t){return isDigit(t)||isFunc(t)||isConst(t)||t==='('}\nfunction endsOperand(t){return isDigit(t)||isConst(t)||isPost(t)||t===')'}\n\n/* ---------- Parser: recursive descent, no eval ---------- */\nfunction CalcError(m){this.message=m}\nfunction lex(tokens){\n  var out=[],i=0;\n  while(i<tokens.length){\n    var t=tokens[i];\n    if(isDigit(t)){\n      var s='';\n      while(i<tokens.length&&(isDigit(tokens[i])||tokens[i]==='E'||(tokens[i]==='−'&&tokens[i-1]==='E'&&s.length))){\n        s+=tokens[i]==='−'?'-':tokens[i]; i++;\n      }\n      if((s.match(/\\./g)||[]).length>1||(s.match(/E/g)||[]).length>1||/E-?$/.test(s)||s==='.')throw new CalcError('number');\n      out.push({k:'n',v:parseFloat(s.replace(/^\\./,'0.'))});\n      continue;\n    }\n    if(t==='E')throw new CalcError('number');\n    out.push({k:t}); i++;\n  }\n  return out;\n}\nfunction evaluate(tokens,ans,angle){\n  var L=lex(tokens),p=0;\n  function peek(){return L[p]}\n  function next(){return L[p++]}\n  function toRad(x){return angle==='deg'?x*Math.PI/180:x}\n  function fromRad(x){return angle==='deg'?x*180/Math.PI:x}\n  function trig(f,x){\n    var r=toRad(x);\n    if(angle==='deg'){ // exact at the angles people type\n      var m=((x%360)+360)%360;\n      if(f==='sin'){ if(m===0||m===180)return 0; if(m===90)return 1; if(m===270)return -1; if(m===30||m===150)return .5; if(m===210||m===330)return -.5; }\n      if(f==='cos'){ if(m===90||m===270)return 0; if(m===0)return 1; if(m===180)return -1; if(m===60||m===300)return .5; if(m===120||m===240)return -.5; }\n      if(f==='tan'){ if(m===0||m===180)return 0; if(m===90||m===270)throw new CalcError('undefined'); if(m===45||m===225)return 1; if(m===135||m===315)return -1; }\n    }\n    return Math[f](r);\n  }\n  function fact(x){\n    if(x<0&&Number.isInteger(x))throw new CalcError('undefined');\n    if(Number.isInteger(x)){ if(x>170)return Infinity; var r=1; for(var i=2;i<=x;i++)r*=i; return r; }\n    return gamma(x+1);\n  }\n  function combo(n,r,perm){\n    if(!Number.isInteger(n)||!Number.isInteger(r)||n<0||r<0||r>n)throw new CalcError('domain');\n    var v=1; for(var i=0;i<r;i++){ v*=(n-i); if(!perm)v/=(i+1); }\n    return perm?v:Math.round(v);\n  }\n  function applyFn(f,x){\n    switch(f){\n      case 'sin(':return trig('sin',x); case 'cos(':return trig('cos',x); case 'tan(':return trig('tan',x);\n      case 'asin(':if(x<-1||x>1)throw new CalcError('domain');return fromRad(Math.asin(x));\n      case 'acos(':if(x<-1||x>1)throw new CalcError('domain');return fromRad(Math.acos(x));\n      case 'atan(':return fromRad(Math.atan(x));\n      case 'sinh(':return Math.sinh(x); case 'cosh(':return Math.cosh(x); case 'tanh(':return Math.tanh(x);\n      case 'ln(':if(x<=0)throw new CalcError('domain');return Math.log(x);\n      case 'log(':if(x<=0)throw new CalcError('domain');return Math.log10(x);\n      case 'log₂(':if(x<=0)throw new CalcError('domain');return Math.log2(x);\n      case '√(':if(x<0)throw new CalcError('domain');return Math.sqrt(x);\n      case '∛(':return Math.cbrt(x);\n      case 'abs(':return Math.abs(x);\n    }\n    throw new CalcError('syntax');\n  }\n  function V(v){return {v:v,pct:false}}\n  function primary(){\n    var t=next(); if(!t)throw new CalcError('incomplete');\n    if(t.k==='n')return V(t.v);\n    if(t.k==='π')return V(Math.PI);\n    if(t.k==='e')return V(Math.E);\n    if(t.k==='Ans')return V(ans);\n    if(t.k==='('){ var v=expr(); if(peek()&&peek().k===')')p++; else if(peek())throw new CalcError('syntax'); return V(v.v); }\n    if(isFunc(t.k)){ var a=expr(); if(peek()&&peek().k===')')p++; else if(peek())throw new CalcError('syntax'); return V(applyFn(t.k,a.v)); }\n    if(t.k==='−')return V(-unary().v);\n    throw new CalcError('syntax');\n  }\n  function postfix(){\n    var a=primary();\n    while(peek()&&isPost(peek().k)){\n      var t=next().k;\n      if(t==='²')a=V(a.v*a.v); else if(t==='³')a=V(a.v*a.v*a.v);\n      else if(t==='!')a=V(fact(a.v));\n      else if(t==='⁻¹'){ if(a.v===0)throw new CalcError('divzero'); a=V(1/a.v); }\n      else if(t==='%')a={v:a.v/100,pct:true,raw:a.v};\n    }\n    return a;\n  }\n  function power(){\n    var a=postfix();\n    if(peek()&&(peek().k==='^'||peek().k==='yroot')){\n      var op=next().k, b=unary();\n      if(op==='^'){ var r=Math.pow(a.v,b.v); if(isNaN(r)&&a.v<0){ var inv=1/b.v; if(Number.isInteger(inv)&&inv%2)r=-Math.pow(-a.v,b.v); } if(isNaN(r))throw new CalcError('domain'); return V(r); }\n      // a ʸ√ b: the a-th root of b\n      if(a.v===0)throw new CalcError('domain');\n      if(b.v<0){ if(Number.isInteger(a.v)&&Math.abs(a.v)%2===1)return V(-Math.pow(-b.v,1/a.v)); throw new CalcError('domain'); }\n      return V(Math.pow(b.v,1/a.v));\n    }\n    return a;\n  }\n  function unary(){\n    if(peek()&&peek().k==='−'){ p++; var a=unary(); return V(-a.v); }\n    if(peek()&&peek().k==='+'){ p++; return unary(); }\n    return power();\n  }\n  function comb(){\n    var a=unary();\n    while(peek()&&(peek().k==='nCr'||peek().k==='nPr')){ var op=next().k, b=unary(); a=V(combo(a.v,b.v,op==='nPr')); }\n    return a;\n  }\n  function term(){\n    var a=comb();\n    for(;;){\n      var t=peek(); if(!t)break;\n      if(t.k==='×'||t.k==='÷'||t.k==='mod'){\n        p++; var b=comb();\n        if(t.k==='×')a=V(a.v*b.v);\n        else if(t.k==='÷'){ if(b.v===0)throw new CalcError('divzero'); a=V(a.v/b.v); }\n        else { if(b.v===0)throw new CalcError('divzero'); a=V(((a.v%b.v)+b.v)%b.v); }\n      } else if(t.k==='n'||t.k==='('||isFunc(t.k)||isConst(t.k)){ // 2π, 3(4), 2sin(30)\n        var c=comb(); a=V(a.v*c.v);\n      } else break;\n    }\n    return a;\n  }\n  function expr(){\n    var a=term();\n    while(peek()&&(peek().k==='+'||peek().k==='−')){\n      var op=next().k, b=term();\n      // 200 + 15% = 230, the way a shop till does it\n      var bv=b.pct?a.v*b.raw/100:b.v;\n      a=V(op==='+'?a.v+bv:a.v-bv);\n    }\n    return a;\n  }\n  if(!L.length)throw new CalcError('empty');\n  var r=expr();\n  if(p<L.length){ if(L[p].k===')')throw new CalcError('syntax'); throw new CalcError('syntax'); }\n  if(!isFinite(r.v))throw new CalcError(isNaN(r.v)?'domain':'overflow');\n  return r.v;\n}\nfunction gamma(z){\n  if(z<.5)return Math.PI/(Math.sin(Math.PI*z)*gamma(1-z));\n  z-=1; var g=7,c=[0.99999999999980993,676.5203681218851,-1259.1392167224028,771.32342877765313,-176.61502916214059,12.507343278686905,-0.13857109526572012,9.9843695780195716e-6,1.5056327351493116e-7];\n  var x=c[0]; for(var i=1;i<g+2;i++)x+=c[i]/(z+i);\n  var t=z+g+.5; return Math.sqrt(2*Math.PI)*Math.pow(t,z+.5)*Math.exp(-t)*x;\n}\nvar ERR={divzero:\"Can't divide by zero\",domain:'Not defined for that value',overflow:'Too large to show',undefined:'Not defined',syntax:'Check the expression',number:'Check that number',incomplete:'Finish the expression',empty:''};\n\n/* ---------- Formatting ---------- */\nvar SUP={'-':'⁻','0':'⁰','1':'¹','2':'²','3':'³','4':'⁴','5':'⁵','6':'⁶','7':'⁷','8':'⁸','9':'⁹'};\nfunction group(intPart){ return intPart.replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g,','); }\nfunction fmt(v,html){\n  if(Object.is(v,-0)||Math.abs(v)<1e-15)v=0;\n  var a=Math.abs(v);\n  if(a!==0&&(a>=1e15||a<1e-9)){\n    var s=v.toExponential(9).replace(/\\.?0+e/,'e'), m=s.split('e'), ex=String(parseInt(m[1],10));\n    m[0]=m[0].replace('-','−');\n    return html?m[0]+'<span class=\"t-op\">×</span>10<span class=\"t-sup\">'+ex+'</span>'\n               :m[0]+'×10'+ex.split('').map(function(c){return SUP[c]||c}).join('');\n  }\n  var r=parseFloat(v.toPrecision(12)), str=String(r);\n  if(/e/.test(str))str=r.toFixed(Math.min(20,Math.max(0,12-Math.floor(Math.log10(a))-1)));\n  var neg=str[0]==='-'; if(neg)str=str.slice(1);\n  var parts=str.split('.');\n  return (neg?'−':'')+group(parts[0])+(parts[1]?'.'+parts[1]:'');\n}\n/* The number as tokens, to put a result back into an expression. */\nfunction numTokens(v){\n  var r=parseFloat(v.toPrecision(12)), s=String(r).replace('e+','E').replace('e','E');\n  var out=[]; for(var i=0;i<s.length;i++){ var c=s[i]; out.push(c==='-'?'−':c); }\n  return out;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Rendering ---------- */\nvar LABEL={'asin(':'sin⁻¹(','acos(':'cos⁻¹(','atan(':'tan⁻¹(','yroot':'ʸ√'};\nfunction esc(s){return s.replace(/[&<>]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;'}[c]})}\nfunction tokenHTML(t,prev){\n  if(t==='E')return '<span class=\"t-e\">E</span>';\n  if(t==='−'&&(prev===undefined||!endsOperand(prev)))return '−';\n  if(isBin(t))return '<span class=\"t-op\">'+esc(LABEL[t]||t)+'</span>';\n  if(t==='²'||t==='³'||t==='⁻¹')return '<span class=\"t-sup\">'+({'²':'2','³':'3','⁻¹':'−1'})[t]+'</span>';\n  if(isFunc(t))return '<span class=\"t-fn\">'+esc(LABEL[t]||t)+'</span>';\n  if(t==='Ans')return '<span class=\"t-fn\">Ans</span>';\n  return esc(t);\n}\nfunction exprHTML(tokens,withGhost){\n  var h='',open=0,run='';\n  function flush(){ if(run){ var parts=run.split('.'); var ip=parts[0].split('E'); h+=group(ip[0])+(ip.length>1?'<span class=\"t-e\">E</span>'+ip[1]:'')+(parts.length>1?'.'+parts.slice(1).join('.'):''); run=''; } }\n  for(var i=0;i<tokens.length;i++){\n    var t=tokens[i];\n    if(isDigit(t)){ run+=t; continue; }\n    flush();\n    if(t==='E'){ h+='<span class=\"t-e\">E</span>'; continue; }\n    if(t==='('||isFunc(t))open++; if(t===')')open--;\n    h+=tokenHTML(t,tokens[i-1]);\n  }\n  flush();\n  if(withGhost&&open>0)h+='<span class=\"t-ghost\">'+new Array(open+1).join(')')+'</span>';\n  return h;\n}\nfunction exprText(tokens){ var d=document.createElement('div'); d.innerHTML=exprHTML(tokens,false); return d.textContent; }\n\nvar main=$('main'),sub=$('sub'),prev=$('prev');\nfunction fitMain(){\n  var land=matchMedia('(orientation:landscape) and (max-height:560px)').matches;\n  var max=land?44:(innerWidth<=350?52:64), min=land?22:30, size=max;\n  main.style.fontSize=size+'px';\n  while(main.scrollWidth>main.clientWidth+1&&size>min){ size-=2; main.style.fontSize=size+'px'; }\n  main.scrollLeft=main.scrollWidth;\n}\nfunction render(){\n  $('angle').textContent=S.angle.toUpperCase();\n  $('memPill').classList.toggle('hide',S.mem===0);\n  $('secPill').classList.toggle('hide',!S.second);\n  document.body.classList.toggle('nosci',!S.sci);\n  sub.classList.remove('err');\n  if(S.shown!==null){\n    prev.textContent=exprText(S.shownExpr)+' =';\n    main.classList.add('result');\n    main.innerHTML=fmt(S.shown,true);\n    sub.textContent='';\n  } else {\n    prev.textContent='';\n    main.classList.remove('result');\n    main.innerHTML=(S.tokens.length?exprHTML(S.tokens,true):'<span style=\"color:var(--faint)\">0</span>')+'<span class=\"caret\"></span>';\n    var pv='';\n    if(S.tokens.length&&!(S.tokens.length===1&&isDigit(S.tokens[0]))){\n      try{ var v=evaluate(S.tokens,S.ans,S.angle); var onlyNum=S.tokens.every(function(t){return isDigit(t)||t==='E'}); if(!onlyNum)pv='= '+fmt(v); }catch(e){}\n    }\n    sub.textContent=pv;\n  }\n  // 2nd layer labels\n  var ks=$('sci').children;\n  for(var i=0;i<ks.length;i++){ var d=SCI[i]; ks[i].innerHTML='<span>'+(S.second&&d[2]?d[2]:d[0])+'</span>'; ks[i].classList.toggle('on',d[1]==='@2nd'&&S.second); }\n  fitMain();\n}\n\n/* ---------- Input ---------- */\nfunction haptic(s){ try{ if(window.myllmHaptic)window.myllmHaptic(s||'light'); }catch(e){} }\nfunction last(){ return S.tokens[S.tokens.length-1]; }\nfunction openCount(){ var n=0; S.tokens.forEach(function(t){ if(t==='('||isFunc(t))n++; else if(t===')')n--; }); return n; }\nfunction currentNumber(){ var i=S.tokens.length-1, s=''; while(i>=0&&(isDigit(S.tokens[i])||S.tokens[i]==='E'||(S.tokens[i]==='−'&&S.tokens[i-1]==='E'))){ s=S.tokens[i]+s; i--; } return {start:i+1,text:s}; }\n/* After =, a digit starts afresh; an operator carries the answer on. */\nfunction leaveResult(forOperator){\n  if(S.shown===null)return;\n  S.tokens=forOperator?['Ans']:[];\n  S.shown=null;\n}\nfunction press(tok){\n  if(tok[0]==='@')return action(tok.slice(1));\n  S.second=false;\n  var cont=isBin(tok)&&tok!=='−'||isPost(tok)||(tok==='−'&&S.shown!==null);\n  leaveResult(cont);\n  var l=last();\n  if(isDigit(tok)){\n    var cn=currentNumber();\n    if(tok==='.'&&(cn.text.indexOf('.')>=0||cn.text.indexOf('E')>=0))return render();\n    if(l!==undefined&&(isConst(l)||l===')'||isPost(l))){ /* implicit ×, allowed */ }\n    if(tok!=='.'&&cn.text==='0')S.tokens.pop(); // no leading zeros\n    if(tok==='.'&&!cn.text)S.tokens.push('0');\n    S.tokens.push(tok);\n  } else if(tok==='E'){\n    var c2=currentNumber(); if(!c2.text||c2.text.indexOf('E')>=0||/\\.$/.test(c2.text))return shake();\n    S.tokens.push('E');\n  } else if(isBin(tok)){\n    if(tok==='−'){\n      // a minus after + or − replaces it; after × ÷ ^ ( it makes the next number negative\n      if(l==='−'||l==='+')S.tokens.pop();\n      S.tokens.push('−');\n    } else {\n      // another operator replaces the one just typed (both, for \"×−\")\n      while(isBin(last()))S.tokens.pop();\n      l=last();\n      if(l===undefined)S.tokens.push(S.history.length?'Ans':'0');\n      else if(l==='('||isFunc(l)||l==='E')return shake();\n      S.tokens.push(tok);\n    }\n  } else if(isPost(tok)){\n    if(l===undefined){ S.tokens.push(S.history.length?'Ans':'0'); }\n    else if(!endsOperand(l))return shake();\n    S.tokens.push(tok);\n  } else if(tok===')'){\n    if(openCount()<=0||l==='('||isFunc(l)||isBin(l))return shake();\n    S.tokens.push(tok);\n  } else {\n    S.tokens.push(tok);\n  }\n  render();\n}\nfunction action(a){\n  if(a==='2nd'){ S.second=!S.second; return render(); }\n  if(a==='ac'){ S.tokens=[]; S.shown=null; S.second=false; return render(); }\n  if(a==='bs'){ if(S.shown!==null){ S.tokens=S.shownExpr.slice(); S.shown=null; return render(); } S.tokens.pop(); return render(); }\n  if(a==='neg'){\n    if(S.shown!==null){ S.tokens=numTokens(-S.shown); S.shown=null; return render(); }\n    var cn=currentNumber(), i=cn.start;\n    if(!cn.text){ var l=last(); if(l===undefined||isBin(l)||l==='('||isFunc(l)){ S.tokens.push('−'); return render(); } return shake(); }\n    var before=S.tokens[i-1], b2=S.tokens[i-2];\n    if(before==='−'&&(b2===undefined||isBin(b2)||b2==='('||isFunc(b2)))S.tokens.splice(i-1,1);\n    else S.tokens.splice(i,0,'−');\n    return render();\n  }\n  if(a==='rand'){ S.second=false; leaveResult(false); numTokens(Math.round(Math.random()*1e6)/1e6).forEach(function(t){S.tokens.push(t)}); return render(); }\n  if(a==='exp'||a==='pow10'){ S.second=false; leaveResult(false); S.tokens.push(a==='exp'?'e':'1'); if(a==='pow10')S.tokens.push('0'); S.tokens.push('^'); S.tokens.push('('); return render(); }\n  if(a==='eq')return equals();\n}\nfunction shake(msg){\n  haptic('error');\n  main.classList.remove('shake'); void main.offsetWidth; main.classList.add('shake');\n  if(msg){ sub.textContent=msg; sub.classList.add('err'); }\n  return false;\n}\nfunction equals(){\n  if(S.shown!==null)return;\n  if(!S.tokens.length)return;\n  try{\n    var v=evaluate(S.tokens,S.ans,S.angle);\n    if(Math.abs(v)<1e-15)v=0;\n    while(openCount()>0)S.tokens.push(')');\n    S.history.push({t:S.tokens.slice(),r:v,a:S.angle});\n    if(S.history.length>60)S.history.shift();\n    S.ans=v; S.shown=v; S.shownExpr=S.tokens.slice(); S.tokens=[];\n    haptic('medium'); save(); render();\n    main.classList.remove('pop'); void main.offsetWidth; main.classList.add('pop');\n  }catch(e){\n    render(); shake(ERR[e.message]!==undefined?ERR[e.message]:'Check the expression');\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---------- Build keys ---------- */\nfunction bindKey(el,fn){\n  // pointerdown feels instant; click is the fallback for keyboard/VoiceOver\n  var fired=false;\n  el.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(e){ if(e.button>0)return; fired=true; el.classList.add('down'); haptic('light'); fn(); });\n  ['pointerup','pointerleave','pointercancel'].forEach(function(n){ el.addEventListener(n,function(){ el.classList.remove('down'); }); });\n  el.addEventListener('click',function(){ if(fired){ fired=false; return; } fn(); });\n}\nSCI.forEach(function(d,i){\n  var b=document.createElement('button'); b.className='k'; b.innerHTML='<span>'+d[0]+'</span>'; b.setAttribute('aria-label',d[0].replace(/<[^>]+>/g,''));\n  bindKey(b,function(){ var dd=SCI[i]; press(S.second&&dd[3]?dd[3]:dd[1]); });\n  $('sci').appendChild(b);\n});\nBASIC.forEach(function(d){\n  var b=document.createElement('button'); b.className='k '+(d[2]||''); b.innerHTML=d[0];\n  b.setAttribute('aria-label',{'@bs':'Delete','@neg':'Plus or minus','@eq':'Equals','@ac':'All clear'}[d[1]]||d[0].replace(/<[^>]+>/g,''));\n  bindKey(b,function(){ press(d[1]); });\n  $('basic').appendChild(b);\n});\n\n/* ---------- Memory ---------- */\nfunction currentValue(){\n  if(S.shown!==null)return S.shown;\n  try{ return evaluate(S.tokens,S.ans,S.angle); }catch(e){ return null; }\n}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.mem [data-m]').forEach(function(b){\n  bindKey(b,function(){\n    var m=b.getAttribute('data-m');\n    if(m==='mc'){ S.mem=0; toast('Memory cleared'); }\n    else if(m==='mr'){ leaveResult(false); var l=last(); if(l!==undefined&&endsOperand(l))S.tokens.push('×'); numTokens(S.mem).forEach(function(t){S.tokens.push(t)}); }\n    else { var v=currentValue(); if(v===null)return shake('Nothing to add yet'); S.mem+=m==='m+'?v:-v; toast('Memory '+fmt(S.mem)); }\n    save(); render();\n  });\n});\nbindKey($('fold'),function(){ S.sci=!S.sci; save(); render(); });\n$('angle').addEventListener('click',function(){ S.angle=S.angle==='deg'?'rad':'deg'; haptic('light'); save(); render(); });\n\n/* ---------- Toast + copy ---------- */\nvar tt;\nfunction toast(msg){ var t=$('toast'); t.textContent=msg; t.classList.add('show'); clearTimeout(tt); tt=setTimeout(function(){t.classList.remove('show')},1300); }\nfunction copyText(s){\n  var ok=false;\n  try{ var ta=document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value=s; ta.setAttribute('readonly',''); ta.style.position='fixed'; ta.style.opacity='0';\n    document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); ta.setSelectionRange(0,s.length); ok=document.execCommand('copy'); document.body.removeChild(ta); }catch(e){}\n  if(!ok&&navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){ navigator.clipboard.writeText(s).then(function(){toast('Copied')},function(){}); return; }\n  toast(ok?'Copied':'Copy not available');\n}\nmain.addEventListener('click',function(){\n  if(S.shown!==null){ copyText(fmt(S.shown).replace(/,/g,'').replace('−','-')); haptic('light'); }\n});\n\n/* ---------- History ---------- */\nfunction renderHistory(){\n  var ul=$('histList'); ul.innerHTML='';\n  if(!S.history.length){ ul.innerHTML='<div class=\"none\">Your sums will appear here.</div>'; return; }\n  S.history.slice().reverse().forEach(function(h){\n    var li=document.createElement('li');\n    li.innerHTML='<div class=\"e\">'+exprHTML(h.t,false)+(h.a==='rad'?' <span class=\"pill\">RAD</span>':'')+' =</div><div class=\"r\">'+fmt(h.r,true)+'</div>';\n    li.addEventListener('click',function(){\n      leaveResult(false);\n      var l=last(); if(l!==undefined&&endsOperand(l))S.tokens.push('×');\n      numTokens(h.r).forEach(function(t){S.tokens.push(t)});\n      closeHistory(); haptic('light'); render();\n    });\n    ul.appendChild(li);\n  });\n}\nfunction openHistory(){ renderHistory(); $('hist').classList.add('open'); $('histBtn').classList.add('on'); }\nfunction closeHistory(){ $('hist').classList.remove('open'); $('histBtn').classList.remove('on'); }\n$('histBtn').addEventListener('click',function(){ haptic('light'); $('hist').classList.contains('open')?closeHistory():openHistory(); });\n$('histDone').addEventListener('click',closeHistory);\n$('histClear').addEventListener('click',function(){ S.history=[]; save(); renderHistory(); haptic('light'); });\n\n/* ---------- Describe a sum (optional AI) ----------\n   The model only writes the expression; this page evaluates it. A model\n   that is bad at arithmetic cannot get the answer wrong, only the reading. */\nvar EXAMPLES=['15% tip on 64.50 split between 3','Area of a circle with radius 7 cm','£1,200 at 4% a year for 5 years','Hypotenuse of a 5 by 12 triangle','Seconds in a leap year'];\nfunction fromText(s){\n  s=String(s||'').trim().replace(/^[`\"']+|[`\"']+$/g,'').replace(/^expression\\s*[:=]\\s*/i,'').replace(/=\\s*[-\\d.,\\s]*$/,'');\n  s=s.replace(/\\*\\*/g,'^').replace(/\\*/g,'×').replace(/\\//g,'÷').replace(/(\\d),(?=\\d{3}\\b)/g,'$1').replace(/[£$€]/g,'');\n  var map=[['asin(','asin('],['acos(','acos('],['atan(','atan('],['arcsin(','asin('],['arccos(','acos('],['arctan(','atan('],\n    ['sinh(','sinh('],['cosh(','cosh('],['tanh(','tanh('],['sin(','sin('],['cos(','cos('],['tan(','tan('],['ln(','ln('],\n    ['log2(','log₂('],['log10(','log('],['log(','log('],['sqrt(','√('],['√(','√('],['cbrt(','∛('],['abs(','abs('],\n    ['mod','mod'],['pi','π'],['π','π'],['Ans','Ans']];\n  var out=[],i=0,prevTok;\n  s=s.replace(/\\s+/g,'');\n  while(i<s.length){\n    var c=s[i], hit=null;\n    for(var k=0;k<map.length;k++){ if(s.substr(i,map[k][0].length).toLowerCase()===map[k][0].toLowerCase()){ hit=map[k]; break; } }\n    if(hit){ out.push(hit[1]); i+=hit[0].length; continue; }\n    if(/[0-9.]/.test(c)){ out.push(c); i++; continue; }\n    if((c==='e'||c==='E')&&/[0-9]/.test(s[i-1]||'')&&/[-+0-9]/.test(s[i+1]||'')){ out.push('E'); if(s[i+1]==='+')i++; i++; continue; }\n    if(c==='e'){ out.push('e'); i++; continue; }\n    if(c==='+'||c==='×'||c==='÷'||c==='^'||c==='('||c===')'||c==='!'||c==='%'){ out.push(c); i++; continue; }\n    if(c==='-'||c==='−'||c==='–'){ out.push('−'); i++; continue; }\n    if(c==='x'||c==='X'||c==='·'){ out.push('×'); i++; continue; }\n    if(c==='²'||c==='³'){ out.push(c); i++; continue; }\n    throw new CalcError('syntax');\n  }\n  return out;\n}\nfunction askAvailable(){ return typeof window.myllmAskJSON==='function'||typeof window.myllmAsk==='function'; }\nfunction openAsk(){\n  $('askMsg').textContent=''; $('scrim').classList.add('open'); $('sheet').classList.add('open');\n  setTimeout(function(){ $('askText').focus(); },280);\n}\nfunction closeAsk(){ $('scrim').classList.remove('open'); $('sheet').classList.remove('open'); $('askText').blur(); }\nEXAMPLES.forEach(function(x){ var b=document.createElement('button'); b.textContent=x; b.onclick=function(){ $('askText').value=x; }; $('chips').appendChild(b); });\n$('askBtn').addEventListener('click',function(){ haptic('light'); openAsk(); });\n$('askCancel').addEventListener('click',closeAsk);\n$('scrim').addEventListener('click',closeAsk);\n$('askGo').addEventListener('click',function(){\n  var q=$('askText').value.trim(); if(!q)return;\n  var go=$('askGo'); go.disabled=true; go.textContent='Reading…'; $('askMsg').textContent='';\n  var rules='Write ONE arithmetic expression that computes the answer to the request below. Use only numbers, + - * / ^ ( ), % for percent, and these functions: sqrt, cbrt, sin, cos, tan, asin, acos, atan, ln, log, abs, pi, e. Degrees for angles. No units, no words, no answer, no equals sign.\\nRequest: '+q;\n  var p=typeof window.myllmAskJSON==='function'\n    ? myllmAskJSON(rules+'\\nReply as JSON with the expression in \"expression\".',{type:'object',required:['expression'],properties:{expression:{type:'string',maxLength:160}}})\n        .then(function(j){ if(!j||typeof j.expression!=='string')throw new Error('no expression'); return j.expression; })\n        .catch(function(){ return myllmAsk(rules+'\\nReply with ONLY the expression.'); })\n    : myllmAsk(rules+'\\nReply with ONLY the expression.');\n  p.then(function(reply){\n    var line=String(reply||'').split('\\n').map(function(x){return x.trim()}).filter(Boolean)[0]||'';\n    var toks=fromText(line);\n    var saved=S.angle; S.angle='deg';\n    evaluate(toks,S.ans,'deg'); // throws if the reading doesn't add up\n    S.tokens=toks; S.shown=null; closeAsk(); equals(); S.angle=saved; save(); render();\n    toast('From: '+q.slice(0,40)+(q.length>40?'…':''));\n  }).catch(function(e){\n    $('askMsg').textContent=e instanceof CalcError?\"The AI's expression didn't add up. Try saying it another way.\":\"Couldn't reach your AI just now.\";\n    haptic('error');\n  }).then(function(){ go.disabled=false; go.textContent='Work it out'; });\n});\n\n/* ---------- Hardware keyboard (iPad) ---------- */\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){\n  if(e.target&&e.target.tagName==='TEXTAREA')return;\n  var k=e.key, map={'*':'×','x':'×','/':'÷','-':'−','+':'+','^':'^','(':'(',')':')','!':'!','%':'%','p':'π','e':'e'};\n  if(/^[0-9.]$/.test(k))press(k);\n  else if(map[k])press(map[k]);\n  else if(k==='Enter'||k==='=')press('@eq');\n  else if(k==='Backspace')press('@bs');\n  else if(k==='Escape')press('@ac');\n  else return;\n  e.preventDefault();\n});\n\naddEventListener('resize',function(){ fitMain(); });\nload(function(){\n  $('askBtn').hidden=!askAvailable();\n  render();\n});\nif(!window.myllmStorage)render();\n\n/* myllm-fullscreen-v2 — full screen where MyLLM can also close the app for us\n   (myllmClose, 5.6.2+): full screen hides MyLLM's Done, and a page with no way\n   out is worse than a repeated title, so elsewhere nothing changes. This page\n   pads its own top by env(safe-area-inset-top), so the spacer stays at 0. */\n(function(){\n  function full(){ return !!(window.myllmClose && window.myllmImmersive); }\n  function sync(){\n    var f = full();\n    document.body.classList.toggle(\"imm\", f);\n    var sp = document.querySelector(\".imm-safe\"); if (sp) sp.style.height = \"0px\";\n    if (!f) return;\n    try { window.myllmImmersive(true, { keepAwake:false }).catch(function(){}); } catch(e){}\n  }\n  window.myllmFSClose = function(){\n    try { if (window.myllmHaptic) window.myllmHaptic(\"light\"); } catch(e){}\n    try { window.myllmClose().catch(function(){}); } catch(e){}\n  };\n  document.addEventListener(\"visibilitychange\", function(){ if (!document.hidden) sync(); });\n  sync();\n})();\n</script></body></html>\n", "kind": "html", "iconSymbol": "plus.forwardslash.minus", "iconColor": "orange"}